A DLL mod that adds automatic HP/FP/Stamina regen over time, plus optional restore-on-hit. Fully configurable via its config file.

[size=4][b][color=#C0860A]F[/color][color=#CF9F31]e[/color][color=#DFB858]a[/color][color=#EED17F]t[/color][color=#EED17F]u[/color][color=#DFB858]r[/color][color=#CF9F31]e[/color][color=#C0860A]s[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Passive HP/FP/Stamina regen on a timer, as flat points, a percent of max, or a percent of missing.[/*]
[*]Optional ceiling on how far passive regen restores you, so it can stop short of full.[/*]
[*]Optionally restrict regen to: out of combat, in combat, idle (no input for a few seconds), or sitting via a gesture.[/*]
[*]Optional restore-on-hit when your own attack lands - fixed amount, percent of max stat, or percent of damage dealt.[/*]
[*]Restore-on-hit can be limited to melee, ranged/spell hits, or both, and can exclude Ash of War/Weapon Art hits.[/*]
[*]Hotkey to reload the ini without restarting the game.[/*]
[/list]

